    solution: 'def valid_date(text):\n    if len(text) == 5 and text[2] == "/" and text[:2].isdigit() and text[3:].isdigit():\n        return True\n    return False\n\ndate = input("Date (DD/MM): ")\nwhile not valid_date(date):\n    print("Use the format DD/MM, such as 05/11")\n    date = input("Date (DD/MM): ")\nprint("Trip booked for", date)',
